'''Valdur''' is a [[ON:Nord|Nord]] whose spirit was bound inside [[Online:Taarengrav|Taarengrav]]. You must release him from the [[ON:Worm Cult|Worm Cult]]'s grasp.

Later, he will accompany the [[ON:Ebonheart Pact|Ebonheart Pact]] to [[ON:Honrich Tower|Honrich Tower]], where he may aid you during the related quest.
